  "content": "\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">免责声明：本作是《Swayles Dweller Island》系列的衍生脑补设定，故事发生在该系列正传的时间线之前！</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">本地图建议搭配恐怖类模组游玩！</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"font-weight:400;color:#fff\" src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/Lr6cw0PKLYQ/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"798\" height=\"598\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 这就是<strong>Dweller Island！</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\">像<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">洞穴栖居者</span>这样的生物曾被囚禁在这座岛上，作为<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">实验</span>对象，随后竟繁殖出了数百个同类！&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\">这些复制体被命名为<strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">Slopskins。</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/xstrYTG7Ts8/hq720.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEhCK4FEIIDSFryq4qpAxMIARUAAAAAGAElAADIQj0AgKJD&rs=AOn4CLDZWKcnwqA4yaXmmo9xNPYDo_2ksg\" alt=\"\" width=\"830\" height=\"467\"></span></p>",
